{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"Shopview Test Management Tool API","version":"1","description":"The native API (`\/api\/v1`). JSON in and out; timestamps are ISO-8601 UTC; ids are TestRail\u0027s where they came from\nTestRail (cases, sections, milestones). Errors are RFC 7807 problem+json. Lists are paged\n(`page`, `per_page` \u2264 250) and return `{data, meta: {page, per_page, total}}`.\n\n**Signing in:** people sign in with Google Workspace in the browser (`GET \/api\/auth\/google\/start`); the SPA then\nexchanges a one-time grant, held in an HttpOnly cookie, for a JWT at `POST \/api\/auth\/session` (no body; 200\n`{\u0022token\u0022: \u0022\u003CJWT\u003E\u0022}`, or 401 when the grant is missing, expired or already used). There is no password login.\nManaging users is for admins signed in this way; API keys never manage users or API keys.\n\n**Automation (CI):** authenticate with an API key (`Authorization: Bearer svtm_\u2026`), create or reuse a run with an\n`external_key`, post results in batches of up to 500 to `POST \/runs\/{id}\/results`, attach files to returned result\nids, and close the run. Every authenticated response carries `X-RateLimit-Limit`, `X-RateLimit-Remaining` and\n`X-RateLimit-Reset`; over the limit is 429 with `Retry-After`. A 503 with `Retry-After` means the database was busy\nafter retries; retry the request.\n\n**Rate limits:** the limiter is a token bucket per API key (or per user for a JWT) holding up to\n`X-RateLimit-Limit` tokens (1200 by default) and refilled steadily at 20 tokens every second (1200\/minute\nsustained). `X-RateLimit-Remaining` is the tokens left in the caller\u0027s bucket right now; `X-RateLimit-Reset` is\nthe Unix time the bucket is full again at that rate, not a fixed window boundary \u2014 it moves with every request.\nA 429\u0027s `Retry-After` is when the next token arrives, usually 1 second. Every authenticated operation can answer\n429, and every write can answer 503; the rate-limit headers are on every authenticated response, errors\nincluded, even where an operation\u0027s responses don\u0027t list them.\n"},"servers":[{"url":"\/api\/v1"}],"security":[{"bearer":[]},{"basic":[]}],"tags":[{"name":"Auth","description":"Sessions and API keys"},{"name":"Users"},{"name":"Projects"},{"name":"Sections"},{"name":"Cases"},{"name":"Imports"},{"name":"Milestones"},{"name":"Runs"},{"name":"Dashboard","description":"Project dashboard (FR-053)"},{"name":"Run items"},{"name":"Results"},{"name":"Attachments"}],"components":{"securitySchemes":{"bearer":{"type":"http","scheme":"bearer","description":"A JWT from `POST \/api\/auth\/session` (after Google sign-in) or `app:user:issue-token`, or an API key `svtm_\u2026`."},"basic":{"type":"http","scheme":"basic","description":"`email:svtm_\u2026` (an API key, never a password)."}},"parameters":{"Id":{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":1}},"Page":{"name":"page","in":"query","schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"default":1}},"PerPage":{"name":"per_page","in":"query","schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":250,"default":50}}},"responses":{"Problem401":{"description":"Not authenticated","content":{"application\/problem+json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#\/components\/schemas\/Problem"}}}},"Problem403":{"description":"Not allowed: only admins manage users, and an API key never manages users or API keys","content":{"application\/problem+json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#\/components\/schemas\/Problem"}}}},"Problem404":{"description":"Not found","content":{"application\/problem+json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#\/components\/schemas\/Problem"}}}},"Problem409":{"description":"Conflicts with the current state (for example a closed run)","content":{"application\/problem+json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#\/components\/schemas\/Problem"}}}},"Problem422":{"description":"Invalid input","content":{"application\/problem+json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#\/components\/schemas\/Problem"}}}},"Problem429":{"description":"Rate limited; see Ret